## 11. Server and UI

### 11.1 API

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/photos?tags=&dupes=collapse&sort=taken_at&offset=&limit=` | Paged grid listing, AND-filtered by tags |
| GET | `/api/photos/{id}` | Detail: metadata, tags with probabilities, RAW path, duplicate group |
| GET | `/api/search/text?q=&tags=&limit=` | Text search, optionally within a tag filter |
| GET | `/api/search/similar/{id}?tags=&limit=` | Similar images |
| GET | `/api/tags` | Tags grouped by family, with counts |
| GET | `/api/raws/unmatched` | Unmatched RAW list |
| GET | `/thumbs/{id}.jpg`, `/previews/{id}.jpg` | Static images |
| GET | `/` | Built Svelte app |

At startup the server loads the embedding matrix and the CLIP text encoder only; the image encoder is not needed at serve time. Tag filters on search are applied as a boolean mask over the matrix before ranking.

### 11.2 UI

A single page with no router; view state lives in a small Svelte store and is mirrored into the URL query string so views can be bookmarked.

- **Top bar:** search input (Enter runs text search), result count, clear button.
- **Left sidebar:** Subject and Scene tag lists with counts. Click a tag to filter, click again to remove. Filters combine with search.
- **Grid:** responsive thumbnail grid with infinite scroll. Badges show RAW and duplicate count.
- **Detail panel:** opens on click. It shows a large preview, capture date, camera and lens, source path, RAW path, tags with probabilities, and GPS coordinates as text. Buttons: **Find similar**, **Copy path**, **Previous/Next**.
- **Keyboard:** arrow keys move between photos, Esc closes the detail panel, `/` focuses search.

Tailwind only; no component library.

## 12. Milestones

| # | Milestone | Estimate | Done when |
